man Jim Jordan (R-OH) is running to lead House Republicans after Tuesday\u2019s Democrat sweep, positioning one of President Donald Trump\u2019s strongest congressional allies to confront the incoming majority.", "large_image": "eBdymlHTHr8nqrIu.png", "title": "Jim Jordan Launches House GOP Leadership Bid as Johnson Steps Aside After Midterm Defeat - Slay News"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYyg240", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 14, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8924190, "raw_content": "https://theconservativetreehouse.com/blog/2026/11/04/initial-perspectives-on-midterm-election-outcome/\n\nBASELINE: Democrats, Leftists and DSA want power; Republicans, corporatists and NRSC want money.\n\nWINNERS: Volodymyr Zelenskyy, Mark Carney, EU-NATO, King Charles and Commonwealth, Globalists, Donald Tusk, Brussels, Chairman Xi, Vladimir Putin, Benjamin Netanyahu, Climate Change Inc., and \u201cmiddle powers\u201d.\n\nLOSERS: President Trump, JD Vance, Karol Nawrocki, Donald Trump Jr., Eric Trump, Tech Bros., Elon Musk, DHS, ICE, DoW, Jensen Huang, Mike Johnson, American middle-class, auto workers and Border Security interests.\n\nOUTCOMES:\n\n(1) Gasoline prices, specifically diesel fuel prices, will likely drop very fast; election objective fulfilled.\n\n(2) For a few months datacenter expansion and approvals will be paused. Datacenters will restart after the federal regulatory sub-agency is created and a series of \u2018indulgency fees\u2019 determined. [Similar to Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (CFPB)].  Those impact fees will be very lucrative.\n\n(3) Congress will quickly act on pre-written legislation to slow AI and introduce government regulation; likely a new regulatory agency will be created and taxes assessed on AI investment under the justification of AI economic impact. AI investment fees and federal datacenter impact fees will be distributed to fungible DNC/DSA aligned NGOs (foreign and domestic) to replace missing USAID funds.  Congress will skim funds as normal (indulgences).\n\n\n(4) Starlink will be nationalized.  The Ukraine vulnerability cannot be allowed again. Elon Musk will have to accept a new regulatory agency as created responsible for space oversight reportable to congress.  This way congress will control the specific mechanisms of Starlink on behalf of allied international stakeholders who do not have their own space program or capability.  More indulgency fees outlined for access, more congressional bribes, payoffs and skimming.\n\n(5) More lucrative SpaceX impact fees will be demanded, same intents as above.  An additional layer of federal oversight and regulatory agency if Musk balks at payments.  All your space are belong to us, not private industry. Connected govt regulatory bureaucracy office, ie. monitors, assigned to SpaceX HQ \u2013 launch approval layer.  Grind Musk down, minimize exceptionalism again.\n\n(6) Tech Bros and Silicon Valley will immediately switch support from Trump to Democrats. No-brainer. Done by December.\n\n(7) ICE will be defunded.  CBP will be severely curtailed. Congress will pass some form of amnesty legislation, no border restrictions (North or South).  Comprehensive immigration reform with familial lineage approvals for additional imports.\n\n(8) Congressional restrictions on executive branch tariff authority.  U.S. Chamber of Commerce will write it from K-Street.\n\n(9) U.S. NATO Stabilization Act and European Strategic Defense spending bill likely for 2027.\n\n(10) Cryptocurrency regulation and creation of U.S. digital currency standard. [Elizabeth Warren]\n\n(11) Surveillance state will expand. Digital identity bill will be part of the Online Privacy Act.  When you set out to maximize power, the #1 priority is to control the ability of that power to be challenged.  The need for control is a reaction to fear.\n\n(12) Russia will be more aggressive toward Ukraine with Trumpian limitations removed.  Putin\u2019s pragmatic expectations of U.S. influence now evident. Russia will also align more with Africa, China and Saudi interests.\n\n(13) China will speed up investments into Canada.\n\n(14) The professionally republican will promote DeSantis again.", "author": "SuperDuperBasedMD", "created": 1793869032987, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "grosmichael", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Sundance's predictions of what's in store for us...", "last_comment_created": 1793871231799, "content": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://theconservativetreehouse.com/blog/2026/11/04/initial-perspectives-on-midterm-election-outcome/\" target=\"_blank\">https://theconservativetreehouse.com/blog/2026/11/04/initial-perspectives-on-midterm-election-outcome/</a></p>\n<p>BASELINE: Democrats, Leftists and DSA want power; Republicans, corporatists and NRSC want money.</p>\n<p>WINNERS: Volodymyr Zelenskyy, Mark Carney, EU-NATO, King Charles and Commonwealth, Globalists, Donald Tusk, Brussels, Chairman Xi, Vladimir Putin, Benjamin Netanyahu, Climate Change Inc., and \u201cmiddle powers\u201d.</p>\n<p>LOSERS: President Trump, JD Vance, Karol Nawrocki, Donald Trump Jr., Eric Trump, Tech Bros., Elon Musk, DHS, ICE, DoW, Jensen Huang, Mike Johnson, American middle-class, auto workers and Border Security interests.</p>\n<p>OUTCOMES:</p>\n<p>(1) Gasoline prices, specifically diesel fuel prices, will likely drop very fast; election objective fulfilled.</p>\n<p>(2) For a few months datacenter expansion and approvals will be paused. Datacenters will restart after the federal regulatory sub-agency is created and a series of \u2018indulgency fees\u2019 determined. [Similar to Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (CFPB)].  Those impact fees will be very lucrative.</p>\n<p>(3) Congress will quickly act on pre-written legislation to slow AI and introduce government regulation; likely a new regulatory agency will be created and taxes assessed on AI investment under the justification of AI economic impact. AI investment fees and federal datacenter impact fees will be distributed to fungible DNC/DSA aligned NGOs (foreign and domestic) to replace missing USAID funds.  Congress will skim funds as normal (indulgences).</p>\n<p>(4) Starlink will be nationalized.  The Ukraine vulnerability cannot be allowed again. Elon Musk will have to accept a new regulatory agency as created responsible for space oversight reportable to congress.  This way congress will control the specific mechanisms of Starlink on behalf of allied international stakeholders who do not have their own space program or capability.  More indulgency fees outlined for access, more congressional bribes, payoffs and skimming.</p>\n<p>(5) More lucrative SpaceX impact fees will be demanded, same intents as above.  An additional layer of federal oversight and regulatory agency if Musk balks at payments.  All your space are belong to us, not private industry. Connected govt regulatory bureaucracy office, ie. monitors, assigned to SpaceX HQ \u2013 launch approval layer.  Grind Musk down, minimize exceptionalism again.</p>\n<p>(6) Tech Bros and Silicon Valley will immediately switch support from Trump to Democrats. No-brainer. Done by December.</p>\n<p>(7) ICE will be defunded.  CBP will be severely curtailed. Congress will pass some form of amnesty legislation, no border restrictions (North or South).  Comprehensive immigration reform with familial lineage approvals for additional imports.</p>\n<p>(8) Congressional restrictions on executive branch tariff authority.  U.S. Chamber of Commerce will write it from K-Street.</p>\n<p>(9) U.S. NATO Stabilization Act and European Strategic Defense spending bill likely for 2027.</p>\n<p>(10) Cryptocurrency regulation and creation of U.S. digital currency standard. [Elizabeth Warren]</p>\n<p>(11) Surveillance state will expand. Digital identity bill will be part of the Online Privacy Act.  When you set out to maximize power, the #1 priority is to control the ability of that power to be challenged.  The need for control is a reaction to fear.</p>\n<p>(12) Russia will be more aggressive toward Ukraine with Trumpian limitations removed.  Putin\u2019s pragmatic expectations of U.S. influence now evident. Russia will also align more with Africa, China and Saudi interests.</p>\n<p>(13) China will speed up investments into Canada.</p>\n<p>(14) The professionally republican will promote DeSantis again.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 14, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}